{"id":2051,"chapter_id":2,"scene_id":205,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"近百个黑帮冒出街头，试图冲破诊所防御。在人群中，你没有看到泰德的身影。","style":3,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"艾恩","content":"他们是来救你的吗，局长？","voice":["vo_cgplot_2051002"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_02","style":1,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"content":"一颗榴弹在你们头顶爆炸，艾恩的义肢帮你挡掉瓦砾。","style":3,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"艾恩","content":"<color=#7683a2><size=32>又是这群流氓混蛋……除了打打杀杀什么都不想，啊……真是浪费时间浪费空气，干脆别要脑袋了，反正他们也用不上……</size></color>","voice":["vo_cgplot_2051004"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_02","style":1,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"speaker":"彼岸医师","content":"糟了糟了，所长最烦这些傻子黑帮了，她快发火了！","voice":["vo_cgplot_2051005"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_02","style":1,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"安","content":"医师？医师？","voice":["vo_cgplot_2051006"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_02","style":1,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"艾恩","content":"……是安啊。怎么了？","voice":["vo_cgplot_2051007"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_02","style":1,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"speaker":"安","content":"狂厄者们，还有那个孩子都不能再受刺激了，我送他们到地下室避难。如果产生了新的伤员，也及时送来吧。","voice":["vo_cgplot_2051008"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_02","style":1,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"安","content":"这里就拜托你了，保护大家，也保护好自己。","voice":["vo_cgplot_2051009"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_02","style":1,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"艾恩","content":"嗯，放心，我很冷静。","voice":["vo_cgplot_2051010"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_02","style":1,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"speaker":"艾恩","content":"再说，还有米诺斯的局长在，对付他们绰绰有余了。","voice":["vo_cgplot_2051011"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_02","style":1,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"speaker":"选项","options":["怎么是我？","交给我吧"],"jump":[13,17],"style":6,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"speaker":"艾恩","content":"彼岸本来有战力，可惜都被你消耗了。不该负起责任吗，局长？","voice":["vo_cgplot_2051013"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_02","style":1,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"speaker":"次级选项","options":["……我好像没有拒绝的选项","……作为回报，我要嫌疑人R"],"jump":[15,15],"style":6,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"speaker":"艾恩","content":"呵。放心，欠你的人情，我一定会还。","voice":["vo_cgplot_2051015"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_02","style":1,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"speaker":"艾恩","content":"……没想到，你会主动站到我们这边。对面可能是来救你的同伴哦？","voice":["vo_cgplot_2051017"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_02","style":1,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"speaker":"次级选项","content":"我已经做出自己的判断","options":["我已经做出自己的判断"],"jump":[19],"style":6,"background":122,"log_type":1},{"step":19,"speaker":"艾恩","content":"是吗，那我期待你的表现。","voice":["vo_cgplot_2051019"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_02","style":1,"background":122,"log_type":1}]}